{TEXT("工兵随车"),TEXT("ENGINEERS WITH ARMOUR")},
{TEXT("两名工兵守在车侧，剪钳和工具随身携带。\n每辆重型坦克附带两名工兵，可清障、抢修受损部件。\n工兵阵亡后，伴随作业停止。"),TEXT("Two sappers keep beside the hull, cutters and tools at hand.\nEvery heavy tank arrives with two engineers who clear obstacles and repair damaged modules.\nTheir deaths leave the vehicle without its escort.")},
{TEXT("工兵伴随"),TEXT("PIONIER ESCORT")},
{TEXT("工兵沿履带压出的通路穿过残丝。\n每辆 A7V 或缴获 Mark IV 附带两名工兵，可清障、抢修受损部件。\n工兵阵亡后，伴随作业停止。"),TEXT("Pioneers follow the tracks through the wire.\nEach A7V or captured Mark IV arrives with two pioneers who clear obstacles and repair damaged modules.\nTheir deaths leave the vehicle without its escort.")},
{TEXT("马克 V 配属"),TEXT("MARK V ALLOCATION")},
{TEXT("驾驶员独自操纵车体，履带转向新阵位。\n解锁 Mark V 与 Mark V*，按行动日期配属。\nMark V* 更善跨越宽壕，长车体转向较慢。"),TEXT("The driver works the new controls alone as the tank turns.\nUnlocks Mark V and Mark V* when their dated allocation arrives.\nMark V* crosses wider cuts; its greater length slows turning.")},
{TEXT("格蕾琴配属"),TEXT("GRETCHEN ALLOCATION")},
{TEXT("车首双机枪占据了原来的炮位。\n解锁 A7V 501 八机枪配置，可替换同槽的火炮型 A7V。\n同时仅一辆 Gretchen 在役。"),TEXT("Twin front guns fill the place of the cannon.\nUnlocks A7V 501's eight-machine-gun configuration as an alternative to the cannon A7V.\nOnly one Gretchen may be active.")},
{TEXT("近距步坦协同"),TEXT("CLOSE INFANTRY ESCORT")},
{TEXT("步兵观察车侧死角里的壕口。\n九米内有存活友军步兵时，坦克机枪命中率提高 10%。\n同类加成只生效一次。"),TEXT("Infantry watch the trench mouths hidden beside the hull.\nLiving friendly infantry within 9 metres give tank machine guns 10% more accuracy.\nThe bonus is applied once.")},
{TEXT("突击队与装甲"),TEXT("STOSSTRUPP AND ARMOUR")},
{TEXT("突击队指出了侧舱下方的敌军枪位。\n九米内有存活友军步兵时，坦克机枪命中率提高 10%。\n同类加成只生效一次。"),TEXT("The assault section points out a gun position beneath the sponson.\nLiving friendly infantry within 9 metres give tank machine guns 10% more accuracy.\nThe bonus is applied once.")},
{TEXT("枪位抢修组"),TEXT("GUN RECOVERY PARTY")},
{TEXT("工兵拆开枪座，车组把备用枪机递到手边。\n每辆战车可由工兵修复一处机枪，恢复 50% 耐久。\n需连续作业八秒，且十一米内无敌军。"),TEXT("A sapper opens the mounting while the crew passes the spare action.\nEngineers can repair one destroyed machine gun per vehicle to 50% durability.\nRequires 8 uninterrupted seconds with no enemy within 11 metres.")},
{TEXT("枪位备件组"),TEXT("ERSATZ GUN CREWS")},
{TEXT("受损枪机从狭窄射孔中卸下。\n每辆战车可由工兵修复一处机枪，恢复 50% 耐久。\n需连续作业八秒，且十一米内无敌军。"),TEXT("The damaged action is lifted through the narrow firing port.\nEngineers can repair one destroyed machine gun per vehicle to 50% durability.\nRequires 8 uninterrupted seconds with no enemy within 11 metres.")},
{TEXT("前沿整备队"),TEXT("FORWARD SERVICE TEAMS")},
{TEXT("工具和油料已运到前沿停车场。\n在工场加成基础上，全部装甲整备时间再缩短 10%。"),TEXT("Tools and fuel wait at the forward tank park.\nAll armour prepares a further 10% sooner after the workshop bonus.")},
{TEXT("前沿修理场"),TEXT("FORWARD REPAIR PARK")},
{TEXT("修复的战车从工场灯下重新驶出。\n在工场加成基础上，全部装甲整备时间再缩短 10%。"),TEXT("A repaired vehicle rolls out beneath the workshop lamps.\nAll armour prepares a further 10% sooner after the workshop bonus.")},
{TEXT("车体检修"),TEXT("HULL OVERHAUL")},
{TEXT("车组在出动前补强了松动的铆接处。\n车体耐久提高 18%。"),TEXT("Crews renew weakened joints before the tank leaves the park.\nHull durability +18%.")},
{TEXT("铆接补强"),TEXT("RIVETED REINFORCEMENT")},
{TEXT("机修工把松动的钢板重新固定在车架上。\n车体耐久提高 22%。"),TEXT("Fitters secure a loose plate against the heavy frame.\nHull durability +22%.")},
{TEXT("传动调校"),TEXT("DRIVE ADJUSTMENT")},
{TEXT("驾驶员缓缓转动传动轴，机修工校正链条。\n装甲移动速度提高 12%。"),TEXT("The fitter aligns the chain while the driver turns the shaft by hand.\nArmour movement speed +12%.")},
{TEXT("传动链检修"),TEXT("DRIVE-CHAIN SERVICE")},
{TEXT("发动机启动前，车组收紧了磨损的传动链。\n装甲移动速度提高 10%。"),TEXT("A worn drive chain is tightened before the engine starts.\nArmour movement speed +10%.")},
{TEXT("弹药接替"),TEXT("AMMUNITION HANDLING")},
{TEXT("空弹盘刚卸下，新的弹盘已送到枪前。\n车载机枪点射恢复间隔缩短 20%。"),TEXT("A fresh drum reaches the gun before the empty one is stowed.\nMachine-gun burst recovery −20%.")},
{TEXT("供弹操练"),TEXT("BELT FEED DRILL")},
{TEXT("下一条弹带在枪手身侧理直铺开。\n车载机枪点射恢复间隔缩短 25%。"),TEXT("The next belt lies straight beside the gunner.\nMachine-gun burst recovery −25%.")},
{TEXT("实心穿甲弹"),TEXT("SOLID SHOT")},
{TEXT("实心弹从炮弹架中单独取出。\n坦克炮对装甲伤害提高 25%。"),TEXT("Solid shot is set apart from the shells in the rack.\nTank cannon damage to armour +25%.")},
{TEXT("穿甲弹储备"),TEXT("ARMOUR-PIERCING RESERVE")},
{TEXT("敌方车体驶入炮镜，装填手取出标记过的炮弹。\n坦克炮对装甲伤害提高 30%。"),TEXT("The loader draws a marked round when the enemy hull appears.\nTank cannon damage to armour +30%.")},
{TEXT("高爆弹储备"),TEXT("HIGH-EXPLOSIVE RESERVE")},
{TEXT("引信装妥的炮弹在出发前送入侧舱。\n坦克炮对步兵的杀伤半径扩大 25%。"),TEXT("Fuzed shells reach the sponsons before the advance.\nTank cannon lethal radius against infantry +25%.")},
{TEXT("工事破击"),TEXT("STRONGPOINT FIRE")},
{TEXT("炮口停在守军工事的入口前。\n坦克炮对步兵的杀伤半径扩大 20%。"),TEXT("The cannon settles on the mouth of the defended position.\nTank cannon lethal radius against infantry +20%.")},
{TEXT("近战枪位操练"),TEXT("CLOSE-QUARTER GUN DRILL")},
{TEXT("枪手紧盯履带旁狭窄的地面。\n车载机枪对十二米内步兵的命中率提高 30%。"),TEXT("The gunner follows the narrow ground beside the tracks.\nMachine-gun accuracy +30% against infantry within 12 metres.")},
{TEXT("侧射枪位操练"),TEXT("FLANK GUN DRILL")},
{TEXT("侧面枪手把逼近车体的敌军纳入射界。\n车载机枪对十二米内步兵的命中率提高 30%。"),TEXT("Side gunners cover the men moving towards the hull.\nMachine-gun accuracy +30% against infantry within 12 metres.")},
{TEXT("战地抢修"),TEXT("FIELD RECOVERY")},
{TEXT("回收队换上前沿停车场送来的备件。\n抢修后的履带和机枪恢复至 75% 耐久。"),TEXT("The recovery party finishes the repair with fresh parts from the tank park.\nRepaired tracks and machine guns return at 75% durability.")},
{TEXT("战地机修队"),TEXT("BATTLEFIELD FITTERS")},
{TEXT("机修工试转修复的枪座，车组重回枪位。\n抢修后的履带和机枪恢复至 75% 耐久。"),TEXT("A fitter tests the restored mounting before the crew returns to its guns.\nRepaired tracks and machine guns return at 75% durability.")},
{TEXT("两侧炮舱越过铁丝网，机枪掩护车旁的步兵。\n双炮支援突击，车体较能承受附近高爆弹，仍须防备反装甲直射。转向缓慢；部署前可换为五机枪配置。"),TEXT("The side sponsons carry guns through the wire, with machine guns covering the infantry at their flanks.\nTwo cannon support assaults on infantry and armour. Heavy plating withstands nearby HE; direct anti-tank fire remains dangerous. Slow turns; a five-gun fit is available before deployment.")},
{TEXT("五挺刘易斯机枪扫过车体周围，步兵紧跟履带前进。\nMark IV 的机枪配置。反步兵火力较强、整备较快，车体可承受附近高爆弹；与火炮配置共用车型槽位。"),TEXT("Five Lewis guns sweep the approaches around the hull while infantry follows in its wake.\nMark IV machine-gun fit: stronger infantry fire, shorter readiness and heavy protection against nearby HE. Shares one platform slot with the cannon fit.")},
{TEXT("四挺霍奇基斯机枪守住狭小战斗舱四周的射界。\n快速履带坦克，擅长在开阔地扩大突破。可追击暴露步兵，装甲较薄，缺少反装甲火炮。"),TEXT("Four Hotchkiss guns face the fields around a compact fighting compartment.\nA fast tracked tank for exploiting open ground. Machine guns punish exposed infantry; light protection and no cannon make armoured duels costly.")},
{TEXT("五十七毫米炮朝向前方，两侧枪手守住高大车体旁的空地。\n一门炮与六挺机枪提供密集火力，车体能承受较多近处炮弹爆炸。崎岖地形妨碍行进，研发后可换为 Gretchen 机枪配置。"),TEXT("The 57 mm gun faces forward; side gun crews watch the approaches along the tall hull.\nOne cannon and six machine guns provide heavy fire. The thick hull resists nearby shell bursts; rough ground hinders travel. Research allows the Gretchen machine-gun fit.")},
{TEXT("缴获的英军车体涂上德军标识，重新驶向前线。\n双炮与机枪支援突击，重型车体抵挡附近高爆弹。缴获备件改善整备，部署前可换为五机枪配置。"),TEXT("A captured British hull enters the line beneath German markings.\nTwo cannon and machine guns support the assault; the heavy hull resists nearby HE. Captured spares shorten readiness; a five-gun fit shares the platform slot.")},
{TEXT("驾驶员操纵改进的传动系统，炮组守住两侧炮舱。\n操纵改善、车体防护增强的火炮坦克，能抵挡较多附近高爆弹。双炮用于突破，整备时间长于 Mark IV。"),TEXT("The driver handles the improved transmission while gun crews cover the sponsons.\nA protected gun tank with improved control and stronger resistance to nearby HE. Two cannon break resistance; readiness is longer than the older Mark IV.")},
{TEXT("工兵携工具跟在坦克后方，处理铁丝网与损坏的行走机构。\n研发工兵伴随后，每辆重型坦克附带两名工兵，随该车一同出动。"),TEXT("Engineers follow the tank with tools for the wire and its damaged running gear.\nResearch Pioneer Escort to attach two engineers to each heavy tank. The escort is part of that tank's call, using no additional armour slot.")},
{TEXT("德军机枪组进入缴获的 Mark IV，接管各处枪位。\n缴获坦克的五机枪配置，专注反步兵，车体抵挡附近高爆弹，整备较快；部署前与火炮配置择一。"),TEXT("German machine-gun crews take their places inside a captured Mark IV.\nFive-gun captured configuration: infantry fire, heavy protection against nearby HE and shorter readiness. Select it in place of the cannon configuration before deployment.")},
{TEXT("八处机枪位遮护方形车体周围的空地。\nA7V 少见的八机枪配置，专注反步兵，车体能承受较多近处炮弹爆炸，整备较快。同一时间仅能保有一辆 Gretchen，缺少火炮。"),TEXT("Eight machine-gun stations cover the space around the box-shaped hull.\nThe rare eight-gun A7V fit combines infantry fire with heavy protection against nearby HE and shorter readiness. Only one Gretchen may be active; it has no cannon.")},
{TEXT("工兵沿缴获车体两侧伴随前进，备件装在工具包中。\n研发工兵伴随后，每辆重型坦克附带两名工兵，可清障和抢修行走机构。"),TEXT("Engineers keep pace beside the captured hull, with spare track parts close at hand.\nResearch Pioneer Escort to attach two engineers to each heavy tank. They clear wire and repair running gear without taking another armour slot.")},
{TEXT("加长车体横越宽壕，新设侧门与后舱枪位遮护车侧。\n双炮、四挺霍奇基斯机枪的重型突破坦克，较能承受附近炮击；仍须防备反装甲直射。转向较慢，整备时间较长。"),TEXT("The lengthened hull crosses broad trenches, while new side doors and rear gun positions guard the flanks.\nA heavy breakthrough tank with two cannon and four Hotchkiss machine guns. Strong against nearby HE; direct anti-tank fire remains dangerous. Slow turns and a long readiness cycle.")},
{TEXT("两座独立维克斯机枪塔俯视发动机罩与后甲板。\n双机枪轮式装甲车，行进和整备较快，擅长追击暴露步兵。弹坑、泥泞与反装甲火炮是其弱点。"),TEXT("Two separate Vickers turrets look out over the bonnet and rear deck.\nA fast wheeled armoured car with two machine guns and short readiness. It hunts exposed infantry on firm ground; shell craters, mud and enemy cannon are dangerous.")},
