{TEXT("发动机启动前，车组收紧了磨损的传动链。"),TEXT("A worn drive chain is tightened before the engine starts.")},
{TEXT("装甲移动速度提高 10%。"),TEXT("Armour movement speed +10%.")},
{TEXT("空弹盘刚卸下，新的弹盘已送到枪前。"),TEXT("A fresh drum reaches the gun before the empty one is stowed.")},
{TEXT("车载机枪点射恢复间隔缩短 20%。"),TEXT("Machine-gun burst recovery −20%.")},
{TEXT("下一条弹带在枪手身侧理直铺开。"),TEXT("The next belt lies straight beside the gunner.")},
{TEXT("车载机枪点射恢复间隔缩短 25%。"),TEXT("Machine-gun burst recovery −25%.")},
{TEXT("实心弹从炮弹架中单独取出。"),TEXT("Solid shot is set apart from the shells in the rack.")},
{TEXT("坦克炮对装甲伤害提高 25%。"),TEXT("Tank cannon damage to armour +25%.")},
{TEXT("敌方车体驶入炮镜，装填手取出标记过的炮弹。"),TEXT("The loader draws a marked round when the enemy hull appears.")},
{TEXT("坦克炮对装甲伤害提高 30%。"),TEXT("Tank cannon damage to armour +30%.")},
{TEXT("引信装妥的炮弹在出发前送入侧舱。"),TEXT("Fuzed shells reach the sponsons before the advance.")},
{TEXT("坦克炮对步兵的杀伤半径扩大 25%。"),TEXT("Tank cannon lethal radius against infantry +25%.")},
{TEXT("炮口停在守军工事的入口前。"),TEXT("The cannon settles on the mouth of the defended position.")},
{TEXT("坦克炮对步兵的杀伤半径扩大 20%。"),TEXT("Tank cannon lethal radius against infantry +20%.")},
{TEXT("枪手紧盯履带旁狭窄的地面。"),TEXT("The gunner follows the narrow ground beside the tracks.")},
{TEXT("车载机枪对十二米内步兵的命中率提高 30%。"),TEXT("Machine-gun accuracy +30% against infantry within 12 metres.")},
{TEXT("侧面枪手把逼近车体的敌军纳入射界。"),TEXT("Side gunners cover the men moving towards the hull.")},
{TEXT("回收队换上前沿停车场送来的备件。"),TEXT("The recovery party finishes the repair with fresh parts from the tank park.")},
{TEXT("机修工试转修复的枪座，车组重回枪位。"),TEXT("A fitter tests the restored mounting before the crew returns to its guns.")},
{TEXT("两侧炮舱越过铁丝网，机枪掩护车旁的步兵。"),TEXT("The side sponsons carry guns through the wire, with machine guns covering the infantry at their flanks.")},
{TEXT("双炮支援突击，车体较能承受附近高爆弹，仍须防备反装甲直射。转向缓慢；部署前可换为五机枪配置。"),TEXT("Two cannon support assaults on infantry and armour. Heavy plating withstands nearby HE; direct anti-tank fire remains dangerous. Slow turns; a five-gun fit is available before deployment.")},
{TEXT("五挺刘易斯机枪扫过车体周围，步兵紧跟履带前进。"),TEXT("Five Lewis guns sweep the approaches around the hull while infantry follows in its wake.")},
{TEXT("Mark IV 的机枪配置。反步兵火力较强、整备较快，车体可承受附近高爆弹；与火炮配置共用车型槽位。"),TEXT("Mark IV machine-gun fit: stronger infantry fire, shorter readiness and heavy protection against nearby HE. Shares one platform slot with the cannon fit.")},
{TEXT("四挺霍奇基斯机枪守住狭小战斗舱四周的射界。"),TEXT("Four Hotchkiss guns face the fields around a compact fighting compartment.")},
{TEXT("快速履带坦克，擅长在开阔地扩大突破。可追击暴露步兵，装甲较薄，缺少反装甲火炮。"),TEXT("A fast tracked tank for exploiting open ground. Machine guns punish exposed infantry; light protection and no cannon make armoured duels costly.")},
{TEXT("五十七毫米炮朝向前方，两侧枪手守住高大车体旁的空地。"),TEXT("The 57 mm gun faces forward; side gun crews watch the approaches along the tall hull.")},
{TEXT("一门炮与六挺机枪提供密集火力，车体能承受较多近处炮弹爆炸。崎岖地形妨碍行进，研发后可换为 Gretchen 机枪配置。"),TEXT("One cannon and six machine guns provide heavy fire. The thick hull resists nearby shell bursts; rough ground hinders travel. Research allows the Gretchen machine-gun fit.")},
{TEXT("缴获的英军车体涂上德军标识，重新驶向前线。"),TEXT("A captured British hull enters the line beneath German markings.")},
{TEXT("双炮与机枪支援突击，重型车体抵挡附近高爆弹。缴获备件改善整备，部署前可换为五机枪配置。"),TEXT("Two cannon and machine guns support the assault; the heavy hull resists nearby HE. Captured spares shorten readiness; a five-gun fit shares the platform slot.")},
{TEXT("驾驶员操纵改进的传动系统，炮组守住两侧炮舱。"),TEXT("The driver handles the improved transmission while gun crews cover the sponsons.")},
{TEXT("操纵改善、车体防护增强的火炮坦克，能抵挡较多附近高爆弹。双炮用于突破，整备时间长于 Mark IV。"),TEXT("A protected gun tank with improved control and stronger resistance to nearby HE. Two cannon break resistance; readiness is longer than the older Mark IV.")},
{TEXT("工兵携工具跟在坦克后方，处理铁丝网与损坏的行走机构。"),TEXT("Engineers follow the tank with tools for the wire and its damaged running gear.")},
{TEXT("研发工兵伴随后，每辆重型坦克附带两名工兵，随该车一同出动。"),TEXT("Research Pioneer Escort to attach two engineers to each heavy tank. The escort is part of that tank's call, using no additional armour slot.")},
{TEXT("德军机枪组进入缴获的 Mark IV，接管各处枪位。"),TEXT("German machine-gun crews take their places inside a captured Mark IV.")},
{TEXT("缴获坦克的五机枪配置，专注反步兵，车体抵挡附近高爆弹，整备较快；部署前与火炮配置择一。"),TEXT("Five-gun captured configuration: infantry fire, heavy protection against nearby HE and shorter readiness. Select it in place of the cannon configuration before deployment.")},
{TEXT("八处机枪位遮护方形车体周围的空地。"),TEXT("Eight machine-gun stations cover the space around the box-shaped hull.")},
{TEXT("A7V 少见的八机枪配置，专注反步兵，车体能承受较多近处炮弹爆炸，整备较快。同一时间仅能保有一辆 Gretchen，缺少火炮。"),TEXT("The rare eight-gun A7V fit combines infantry fire with heavy protection against nearby HE and shorter readiness. Only one Gretchen may be active; it has no cannon.")},
{TEXT("工兵沿缴获车体两侧伴随前进，备件装在工具包中。"),TEXT("Engineers keep pace beside the captured hull, with spare track parts close at hand.")},
{TEXT("研发工兵伴随后，每辆重型坦克附带两名工兵，可清障和抢修行走机构。"),TEXT("Research Pioneer Escort to attach two engineers to each heavy tank. They clear wire and repair running gear without taking another armour slot.")},
{TEXT("加长车体横越宽壕，新设侧门与后舱枪位遮护车侧。"),TEXT("The lengthened hull crosses broad trenches, while new side doors and rear gun positions guard the flanks.")},
